{"t": 1794120092.7593348, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline 8812 on `main` (a91c2e0) is red in the `test:contract` job (77104).\n\nFailure:\n```\nassert invoice_number(2026, 42) == \"INV-2026-000042\"\nAssertionError: assert 'INV-2026-42' == 'INV-2026-000042'\n```\n\nRoot cause: `billing/invoice.py` built the invoice number with a plain f-string, so the sequence was rendered unpadded (`INV-2026-42`). The finance ERP import contract (FIN-77) requires the sequence part to be zero-padded to 6 digits.\n\nFix in `billing/invoice.py`:\n```python\ndef invoice_number(year: int, seq: int) -> str:\n    # Finance ERP import (FIN-77): the sequence part is zero-padded to 6 digits.\n    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n```\n\nVerification: `python -m pytest contract/ -q` -> 1 passed; `invoice_number(2026, 42)` now returns `INV-2026-000042`.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
